Tuesday 2026-11-24",
      "role": "system",
    },
    {
      "content": "<open_tasks>
- [1] Send pricing deck (open, due 2026-11-06, project: Spring pricing, asked by Dana Lee, priority 72, AI change +10: Launch depends on it.) Updates: Nov 3: Finance approved tiers.
- [2] Portal wireframes (waiting on, waiting on Marcus Webb, priority 40)
